  "published_at": "2026-07-20T08:22:20.000Z",
  "content_updated_at": "2026-07-20T08:22:20.000Z",
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"rR8ue\" id=\"rR8ue\"><span data-lake-id=\"u890487fa\" id=\"u890487fa\">1. 要解决的问题</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucb1f7066\" id=\"ucb1f7066\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6826ffbd\" id=\"u6826ffbd\">模型请求、文件处理和 Spark Job 都可能阻塞数秒甚至更久。如果在 Textual 事件循环中同步执行，界面会冻结；如果后台线程直接修改 Widget，又会产生线程安全问题。设计目标是让 UI 保持响应，同时让执行逻辑与界面解耦。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"U2Cpp\" id=\"U2Cpp\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6013b57\" id=\"ue6013b57\">2. 组件与线程边界</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22flowchart%20LR%5Cn%20%20%20%20subgraph%20Main%5B%5C%22Textual%20%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Input%5B%5C%22Input.Submitted%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Widgets%5B%5C%22Conversation%20Widgets%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Topbar%5B%5C%22READY%20%2F%20THINKING%20%2F%20ERROR%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Update%5B%5C%22_replace_message()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20subgraph%20Worker%5B%5C%22%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%20worker%20%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Stream%5B%5C%22_stream_response()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Buffer%5B%5C%22%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%20buffer%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20subgraph%20App%5B%5C%22Application%20%E5%B1%82%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Service%5B%5C%22WorkbenchService.stream_input()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20subgraph%20Backend%5B%5C%22%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Model%5B%5C%22ModelRouter%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20File%5B%5C%22FileTaskService%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Agent%5B%5C%22AgentRuntime%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Input%20--%3E%7C%5C%22run_worker(thread%3DTrue)%5C%22%7C%20Stream%5Cn%20%20%20%20Stream%20--%3E%20Service%5Cn%20%20%20%20Service%20--%3E%20Model%5Cn%20%20%20%20Service%20--%3E%20File%5Cn%20%20%20%20Service%20--%3E%20Agent%5Cn%20%20%20%20Model%20--%3E%20Service%5Cn%20%20%20%20File%20--%3E%20Service%5Cn%20%20%20%20Agent%20--%3E%20Service%5Cn%20%20%20%20Service%20--%3E%20Stream%5Cn%20%20%20%20Stream%20--%3E%20Buffer%5Cn%20%20%20%20Buffer%20--%3E%7C%5C%22call_from_thread()%5C%22%7C%20Update%5Cn%20%20%20%20Update%20--%3E%20Widgets%5Cn%20%20%20%20Stream%20--%3E%7C%5C%22call_from_thread()%5C%22%7C%20Topbar%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F21074f6af8678dfd6ea8a6633fff389d.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22NIIaH%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u88191318\" id=\"u88191318\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e6863a9\" id=\"u8e6863a9\">后台线程不能直接操作 Textual Widget。所有 UI 变更都通过 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub2e16e37\" id=\"ub2e16e37\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufbf9a579\" id=\"ufbf9a579\">call_from_thread()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uae851fdd\" id=\"uae851fdd\"> 切回主线程，这是整个设计最关键的线程边界。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"QXbvy\" id=\"QXbvy\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77eb34c1\" id=\"u77eb34c1\">3. 一次输入的完整交互</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sequenceDiagram%5Cn%20%20%20%20autonumber%5Cn%20%20%20%20actor%20User%20as%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Main%20as%20Textual%20%E4%B8%BB%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Worker%20as%20Worker%20%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20WB%20as%20WorkbenchService%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Backend%20as%20Model%2FFile%2FAgent%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20User-%3E%3EMain%3A%20Input.Submitted%5Cn%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%B9%B6%E6%B8%85%E7%A9%BA%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%A1%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD%E7%A9%BA%E7%9A%84%20Agent%20response%20widget%5Cn%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%BA%20THINKING%5Cn%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EWorker%3A%20run_worker(_stream_response%2C%20thread%3DTrue)%5Cn%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EWB%3A%20stream_input(user_input)%5Cn%20%20%20%20WB-%3E%3EBackend%3A%20%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%B9%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20loop%20%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%20chunk%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Backend--%3E%3EWB%3A%20chunk%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20WB--%3E%3EWorker%3A%20chunk%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EWorker%3A%20buffer%20%2B%3D%20chunk%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20call_from_thread(_replace_message)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Main-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%20buffer%20%E5%B9%B6%20scroll_end%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%20%20%20%20alt%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%8A%9B%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%BA%20ERROR%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%92%8C%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%20%E6%97%A0%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E2%80%9C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%93%8D%E5%BA%94%E2%80%9D%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E5%B9%B6%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%20model%20fallback%20warning%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Worker-%3E%3EMain%3A%20%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%20READY%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2Fe5abb0ec2d37d115c4d0009805b8137c.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22yAYlu%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud4c9d5a1\" id=\"ud4c9d5a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39f47f1b\" id=\"u39f47f1b\">输入先上屏、再启动后端，因此用户能立即确认请求已接收。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u72d6c66c\" id=\"u72d6c66c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53f21c05\" id=\"u53f21c05\">response_widget</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc9bfdd32\" id=\"uc9bfdd32\"> 在主线程创建，再作为引用传给 worker；worker 只通过调度回主线程更新它。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"oc6RR\" id=\"oc6RR\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6aa5b628\" id=\"u6aa5b628\">4. 统一流接口与三种语义</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue18d7378\" id=\"ue18d7378\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1d8c11a4\" id=\"u1d8c11a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4620611\" id=\"ue4620611\">WorkbenchService.stream_input()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u701123de\" id=\"u701123de\"> 把不同后端统一成 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udab5d7f6\" id=\"udab5d7f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91e20931\" id=\"u91e20931\">Iterable[str]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1256780\" id=\"uf1256780\">，但三种路径的“流式”含义不同。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22flowchart%20TD%5Cn%20%20%20%20I%5B%5C%22stream_input(user_input)%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20Route%7B%5C%22%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Route%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%5C%22%7C%20Chat%5B%5C%22ModelRouter.stream_chat()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Chat%20--%3E%20Real%5B%5C%22%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%20token%20%E5%A2%9E%E9%87%8F%E6%B5%81%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Route%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%40%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%5C%22%7C%20File%5B%5C%22FileTaskService.run()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20File%20--%3E%20Chunk%5B%5C%22%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%90%8E%E7%94%B1%20_stream_text()%20%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E5%88%87%E5%9D%97%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Route%20--%3E%7C%5C%22Agent%20%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%5C%22%7C%20Agent%5B%5C%22AgentRuntime.stream()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Agent%20--%3E%20Run%5B%5C%22%E5%85%88%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%20run()%20%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Run%20--%3E%20Format%5B%5C%22%E5%86%8D%E7%94%B1%20format_stream()%20%E5%88%86%E6%AE%B5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5C%22%5D%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2Fa24a8cc7ef3bdc41eb84e567f101571c.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22sFYmB%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4385b356\" id=\"u4385b356\"><span data-lake-id=\"u70ce485a\" id=\"u70ce485a\">因此当前 TUI 的视觉效果都是逐步出现，但只有模型网关路径可能是真正的生成中流式；Agent 不会在每个 Skill 开始或 artifact 创建时实时发事件。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ivRwE\" id=\"ivRwE\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc63455b4\" id=\"uc63455b4\">5. 状态栏与模型降级</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua3ec2df7\" id=\"ua3ec2df7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf0b3e19\" id=\"ubf0b3e19\">状态栏每次更新三个区域：runtime status、model name、累计 used token。</span><code data-lake-id=\"udc0162c9\" id=\"udc0162c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7264491\" id=\"ub7264491\">ModelRouter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0ae71d5e\" id=\"u0ae71d5e\"> 在主 provider 异常时保存 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3c6d915a\" id=\"u3c6d915a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10b34b25\" id=\"u10b34b25\">_last_error</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u22b99e27\" id=\"u22b99e27\">，fallback 成功后请求整体不会进入 ERROR，但 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub65e0a2d\" id=\"ub65e0a2d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89f83957\" id=\"u89f83957\">_append_model_warning()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7454b1f3\" id=\"u7454b1f3\"> 会追加一条 warning，说明主模型失败和实际降级来源。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22stateDiagram-v2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B*%5D%20--%3E%20READY%3A%20on_mount%5Cn%20%20%20%20READY%20--%3E%20THINKING%3A%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E9%9D%9E%E7%A9%BA%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20THINKING%20--%3E%20READY%3A%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E6%88%96%20fallback%20%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5Cn%20%20%20%20THINKING%20--%3E%20ERROR%3A%20%E6%9C%AA%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%5Cn%20%20%20%20ERROR%20--%3E%20THINKING%3A%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%5Cn%20%20%20%20READY%20--%3E%20%5B*%5D%3A%20quit%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F4dc232a855fcd44b8755a1d17716fc8c.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22mO1MY%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"aEslL\" id=\"aEslL\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56ae6405\" id=\"u56ae6405\">6. 当前并发行为</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc938025d\" id=\"uc938025d\"><code data-lake-id=\"udf59a3ec\" id=\"udf59a3ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9af2bb4\" id=\"ub9af2bb4\">run_worker(..., exclusive=False)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u803f1207\" id=\"u803f1207\"> 允许多个输入并发执行。这不会自动保证业务隔离：</span></p><ul list=\"u84057658\"><li fid=\"ud131d601\" data-lake-id=\"u2273e0b7\" id=\"u2273e0b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd9b5eb8\" id=\"udd9b5eb8\">每个请求有独立 response widget 和局部 buffer，因此文本一般不会互相覆盖。</span></li><li fid=\"ud131d601\" data-lake-id=\"u3c0d983a\" id=\"u3c0d983a\"><code data-lake-id=\"u092aea3e\" id=\"u092aea3e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ddbfb2a\" id=\"u6ddbfb2a\">WorkbenchService</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7a0b60f6\" id=\"u7a0b60f6\">、模型 gateway 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc722ea9e\" id=\"uc722ea9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d688501\" id=\"u7d688501\">AgentRuntime</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uffa6ed7e\" id=\"uffa6ed7e\"> 是共享实例。</span></li><li fid=\"ud131d601\" data-lake-id=\"u8d92a76f\" id=\"u8d92a76f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u42e29f2f\" id=\"u42e29f2f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56d7704e\" id=\"u56d7704e\">SparkToolExecutor._run_results</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf942d3eb\" id=\"uf942d3eb\"> 是共享可变字典，依赖不同 run_id 隔离。</span></li><li fid=\"ud131d601\" data-lake-id=\"u1654516c\" id=\"u1654516c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe2a047b\" id=\"ufe2a047b\">SQLite 支持基础串行写入，但高并发锁争用没有治理。</span></li><li fid=\"ud131d601\" data-lake-id=\"ua2f4e51c\" id=\"ua2f4e51c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1314b94a\" id=\"u1314b94a\">Spark、模型 API 和 Docker 容器没有统一并发配额。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ubdbaf123\" id=\"ubdbaf123\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7df24e9\" id=\"uc7df24e9\">本项目定位为本地单用户工作台，不能据此声称支持多租户高并发。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"io630\" id=\"io630\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc05185e6\" id=\"uc05185e6\">7. 渲染与背压难点</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"KnGfF\" id=\"KnGfF\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02103c0c\" id=\"u02103c0c\">累积 buffer 的复制成本</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u1f7591d0\" id=\"u1f7591d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue50b7be7\" id=\"ue50b7be7\">每个 chunk 都执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2b2425b3\" id=\"u2b2425b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua12f523e\" id=\"ua12f523e\">buffer += chunk</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u99b04696\" id=\"u99b04696\">，然后把完整 buffer 传给 Widget 更新。长文本下可能产生重复字符串复制和重复渲染。可以按时间窗口合并 chunk，例如每 30–50ms 刷新一次。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"sHNq3\" id=\"sHNq3\"><code data-lake-id=\"u58971e01\" id=\"u58971e01\"><span data-lake-id=\"u707825c0\" id=\"u707825c0\">sleep(0.01)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc9bbe510\" id=\"uc9bbe510\"> 不是背压</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6c127149\" id=\"u6c127149\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd0aa61e\" id=\"udd0aa61e\">它只控制视觉节奏。真正背压需要有界队列：生产者队列满时等待或合并普通 token；状态变更、错误、artifact 等关键事件不能丢弃。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"NdnW8\" id=\"NdnW8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad4dc32a\" id=\"uad4dc32a\">取消需要贯穿所有层</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u768f83a8\" id=\"u768f83a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ba45de6\" id=\"u6ba45de6\">Textual worker 取消不等于 Spark Job 取消。取消信号需要经过 UI → WorkbenchService → AgentRuntime → JobOrchestrator → Docker/Livy/Spark，并处理取消与成功回调竞态。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"yTuLF\" id=\"yTuLF\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud23935ef\" id=\"ud23935ef\">更合理的事件协议</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2c0110b4\" id=\"u2c0110b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a7fb181\" id=\"u3a7fb181\">当前所有响应都是字符串。生产化可定义：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22latex%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22RunEvent%20%3D%20TokenDelta%20%7C%20StepStarted%20%7C%20StepCompleted%20%7C%20ArtifactCreated%20%7C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20JobStatusChanged%20%7C%20WarningRaised%20%7C%20RunFailed%20%7C%20RunCompleted%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xzfbQ%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3607290e\" id=\"u3607290e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4bf8c00\" id=\"ue4bf8c00\">TUI、SSE 和 WebSocket 只负责消费同一事件流。这样才能显示真实步骤进度、结构化错误和可点击 artifact，而不是解析字符串。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Ipwfr\" id=\"Ipwfr\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4f5f747\" id=\"uc4f5f747\">8. 异常路径</span></h2><ul list=\"uf38f5c03\"><li fid=\"ud08c6963\" data-lake-id=\"udc99e449\" id=\"udc99e449\"><code data-lake-id=\"ucb557ffd\" id=\"ucb557ffd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u260f1eec\" id=\"u260f1eec\">_stream_response()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uce98b30d\" id=\"uce98b30d\"> 捕获任意异常，切换 ERROR 并展示异常类型。</span></li><li fid=\"ud08c6963\" data-lake-id=\"u6cc27d14\" id=\"u6cc27d14\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7cbb1e75\" id=\"u7cbb1e75\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1b987ff\" id=\"ud1b987ff\">_format_error()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8c85b1f2\" id=\"u8c85b1f2\"> 当前提示检查 master-model 三个配置槽位，适合模型错误，但对文件或 Spark 错误不够精确。</span></li><li fid=\"ud08c6963\" data-lake-id=\"u42596f9d\" id=\"u42596f9d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a4d187a\" id=\"u0a4d187a\">主模型失败、fallback 成功不进入 ERROR，而是 READY + warning。</span></li><li fid=\"ud08c6963\" data-lake-id=\"ua2df4ca9\" id=\"ua2df4ca9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e5f6867\" id=\"u9e5f6867\">空流会显示“没有生成响应”，避免留下永久空白气泡。</span></li><li fid=\"ud08c6963\" data-lake-id=\"u3505b02d\" id=\"u3505b02d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa15d687\" id=\"ufa15d687\">当前没有超时，阻塞后端可能让 worker 长时间停留在 THINKING。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"QAMB2\" id=\"QAMB2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u809f78fc\" id=\"u809f78fc\">9. 源码索引</span></h2><ul list=\"u1ec02823\"><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"ub4692d83\" id=\"ub4692d83\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua33581a4\" id=\"ua33581a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62937dd8\" id=\"u62937dd8\">sparkos/interfaces/tui/app.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uff5798aa\" id=\"uff5798aa\">：Textual 事件、worker 和 UI 更新。</span></li><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"u7cfb307b\" id=\"u7cfb307b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u95e6e3d2\" id=\"u95e6e3d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf71957ba\" id=\"uf71957ba\">sparkos/application/workbench.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3dd29fd6\" id=\"u3dd29fd6\">：统一流接口。</span></li><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"ufbc42cd3\" id=\"ufbc42cd3\"><code data-lake-id=\"u71ff656c\" id=\"u71ff656c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf40e894f\" id=\"uf40e894f\">sparkos/infrastructure/llm/model_router.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u754d296c\" id=\"u754d296c\">：真实模型流和 fallback。</span></li><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"ufa528d55\" id=\"ufa528d55\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc6081e94\" id=\"uc6081e94\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6234e218\" id=\"u6234e218\">sparkos/application/agent_runtime.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub342344c\" id=\"ub342344c\">：同步执行后格式化。</span></li><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"ub86fd6a3\" id=\"ub86fd6a3\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4840ebb0\" id=\"u4840ebb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54798cd4\" id=\"u54798cd4\">sparkos/interfaces/terminal/chat.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3aabc11b\" id=\"u3aabc11b\">：同一 Service 的终端适配。</span></li><li fid=\"u1b1f68e0\" data-lake-id=\"u8f389ca7\" id=\"u8f389ca7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4f26f8c5\" id=\"u4f26f8c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ad5e763\" id=\"u4ad5e763\">tests/test_workbench.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc17ac3d7\" id=\"uc17ac3d7\">：聊天与文件任务 chunk 测试。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"V1lGP\" id=\"V1lGP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8209d7aa\" id=\"u8209d7aa\">10. 如何向面试官概括</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ue0de3f74\" id=\"ue0de3f74\"><p data-lake-id=\"ufdb20659\" id=\"ufdb20659\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9223f382\" id=\"u9223f382\">我把 Textual 主线程和阻塞后端严格分开：worker 执行 Service，所有 Widget 更新通过 call_from_thread 回主线程。统一 Iterable 接口隐藏了后端差异，但我也明确区分了模型真流式、文件切块和 Agent 执行后分段输出。生产化重点是结构化 RunEvent、背压、取消和任务隔离。</span></p></blockquote>",
  "empty_unpublished": false,
  "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T16:25:13+08:00"
}